                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>1. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'># of Agent&apos;s Adoption </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>= Unique Count of United UI Agents ( How many agents adopted United UI) </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>2. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Agent Adoption % </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>= Unique Count of United UI Agents/ Unique Count of Agents</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#fefaf1' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8236' id='17' type-v2='text' w='49352' x='49997' y='25217'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Notes: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>1. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Only &apos;Week&apos; level date granularity is available.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular'>2. There is overlapping of the agents across stakeholder dimension and our recommendation is not to sum up that as it&apos;ll show&gt;100% having duplicacy issue.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#fefaf1' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
